<title>PORTUGAL: Portuguese bonds dip but end off lows.</title>
<headline>Portuguese bonds dip but end off lows.</headline>
<text>
<p>1800 GMT - Bonds close down but off lows, reflecting better tone in foreign centres, particularly Spain. Traders see 10-year spread with Spain holding around 10 basis points.</p>
<p>*June 97 futures down 0.13 at 107.60 vs Tues close</p>
<p>*Feb 07 cash 99.15 vs 99.25. Yld 6.74 vs 6.73</p>
<p>*Spread vs Spanish 10-yr cash -8 bps vs -6 bps</p>
</text>
